            {
              "id": "9b276a96-24e2-301c-9350-b56975553f23",
              "name": "resources.rules.raptor-insecure-api-atoi-atol-atof",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Opengrep Finding: resources.rules.raptor-insecure-api-atoi-atol-atof"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "The atoi(), atol(), atof(), and similar functions don't handle errors. They don't check for integer overflow and can return a negative value.  They have undefined behavior if the value of the result cannot be  represented. They return 0 (or 0.0) if the string does not represent  an integer (or decimal), which is indistinguishable from a correctly  formatted, zero-denoting input string."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "enabled": true,
                "level": "note"
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "The atoi(), atol(), atof(), and similar functions don't handle errors. They don't check for integer overflow and can return a negative value.  They have undefined behavior if the value of the result cannot be  represented. They return 0 (or 0.0) if the string does not represent  an integer (or decimal), which is indistinguishable from a correctly  formatted, zero-denoting input string.\n💎 Enable cross-file analysis and Pro rules for free at sg.run/pro",
                "markdown": "The atoi(), atol(), atof(), and similar functions don't handle errors. They don't check for integer overflow and can return a negative value.  They have undefined behavior if the value of the result cannot be  represented. They return 0 (or 0.0) if the string does not represent  an integer (or decimal), which is indistinguishable from a correctly  formatted, zero-denoting input string.\n\n#### 💎 Enable cross-file analysis and Pro rules for free at <a href='https://sg.run/pro'>sg.run/pro</a>\n\n<b>References:</b>\n - [https://rules.sonarsource.com/c/type/Bug/RSPEC-989](https://rules.sonarsource.com/c/type/Bug/RSPEC-989)\n - [https://wiki.sei.cmu.edu/confluence/display/c/ERR34-C.+Detect+errors+when+converting+a+string+to+a+number](https://wiki.sei.cmu.edu/confluence/display/c/ERR34-C.+Detect+errors+when+converting+a+string+to+a+number)\n"
              },
              "properties": {
                "precision": "very-high",
                "tags": [
                  "resources.rules.raptor-insecure-api-atoi-atol-atof"
                ]
              }
            },
