                "markdown": "Most codebases define assertion macros which compile to a no-op on non-debug builds. If assertions are the only line of defense against untrusted input, the software may be exposed to attacks that leverage the lack of proper input checks.\n\n#### 💎 Enable cross-file analysis and Pro rules for free at <a href='https://sg.run/pro'>sg.run/pro</a>\n\n<b>References:</b>\n - [https://legends2k.github.io/note/assert_vs_if/](https://legends2k.github.io/note/assert_vs_if/)\n - [https://github.com/struct/mms](https://github.com/struct/mms)\n"
